{"skill":{"slug":"juejin-skills","displayName":"掘金技能集"},"version":{"version":"1.0.8","createdAt":1780239746131,"changelog":"重新发布1.0.7版本的安全修复：./output写边界守卫(_validate_output_dir) + download_user_articles双重确认门(confirm_bulk=True) + 批量硬上限BULK_DOWNLOAD_HARD_CAP=50；SKILL.md声明bulk_download_policy","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"README.md","size":4336,"sha256":"d3eae6677b59635e53264ffc6a72195b66eb442067d69a3966d63ac707279df6","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"SKILL.md","size":15538,"sha256":"2676591a780f7f93bc4e356842ef05df94306dca73c517935735cfb2d985ce8d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"juejin_skill/__init__.py","size":443,"sha256":"6edd38eb91ae2470766f68b5e119a736536ef6d3f2da379737fd03a14b923ba4","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"juejin_skill/api.py","size":2678,"sha256":"8efc564a12b05bb4d86afe09e730a1a802e2d3b7e79220860fcfce174f5ad0bf","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"juejin_skill/auth.py","size":5693,"sha256":"6b366f26c38229b228348d5ce24a739c7c1f5d0625fbbd927c1c6e1e44fec5ac","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"juejin_skill/config.py","size":3106,"sha256":"7f4c249fc81a46bbaf6961d7928df8ba7d183d199fbe1107856b40685191693f","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"juejin_skill/downloader.py","size":27552,"sha256":"13b34d7a68d81f05e7572b8b9ad94190860859ad778cb3f37604c7bc8952be12","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"juejin_skill/hot_articles.py","size":6917,"sha256":"0f0ef32d8965d5d918ae701518a7b0688aa8f0abb151ec8b8165d847a2c821a0","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"juejin_skill/publisher.py","size":15110,"sha256":"5d16dd371a920460de686a8dee1c2d57715ce3d43e94232d3ec236e5d55dd0fe","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"juejin_skill/utils.py","size":2681,"sha256":"db664e4d18aff7924195af9b425c4b650ef51d3e718a154295ec11876bcfd2ec","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"publish_article.py","size":8539,"sha256":"204ab1145b0f528871f1aeb8648b6ada956063c40ad795669bebf4e3df9ff4a8","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"requirements.txt","size":88,"sha256":"2accb774a3f4ced3ac70c2f52e8a548aab64b8e4593e7f7d32645515afde2bfb","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"run_publish.py","size":4722,"sha256":"c91624ed0cc73b14fddf7fbdf000488989871cdff100e4e7e85130775e821b14","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2928,"sha256":"72407a59b6b2464579c601d8aa043da9071489dbeb9cad59ebef9a698abfb459","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789184213170,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"daf06111d6f4202c61688032a23ae7606f0eb0559f305c35e018f0ff049e6d0d","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/daf06111d6f4202c61688032a23ae7606f0eb0559f305c35e018f0ff049e6d0d","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780243609322},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":100,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":17,"checkedAt":1789184213170},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is mostly coherent for Juejin publishing and downloading, but it exposes sensitive session-cookie and file-write behavior beyond its declared limits, so users should review it carefully before installing.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, browser automation, local Markdown reads, and output writes fit the purpose. The concerns are that image downloads follow redirects after only initial host allowlisting, and the authenticated HTTP client lacks destination validation.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"Installation is ordinary Python dependency installation plus Playwright Chromium setup. A pinned lxml dependency was flagged as vulnerable, which is a dependency hygiene concern rather than evidence of malicious installation behavior.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"SKILL.md provides narrow activation rules, explicit user-input requirements, draft-only defaults, bulk-download confirmation, and warnings around credentials. These controls are clear, but they rely on callers using the higher-level workflows rather than the lower-level public API escape hatches.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill clearly discloses persistent storage of the Juejin session cookie at ~/.juejin_cookie.json with 0600 permissions and removal guidance. The configurable cookie_path in JuejinAuth can nevertheless write or delete arbitrary caller-selected writable paths, which exceeds the advertised credential-file scope.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is coherent: query Juejin, create drafts or publish articles, and download Juejin articles. However, the exported JuejinAPI can send an authenticated Cookie header to any caller-supplied URL, which exceeds the declared Juejin-only network boundary.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Install only if you trust this publisher with your Juejin account session. Use it on a personal machine, avoid shared or CI environments, keep public publishing in draft-only mode unless intentionally confirming publication, and delete ~/.juejin_cookie.json when finished. Treat the lower-level Python API as unsafe for untrusted callers until URL validation, cookie-path constraints, redirect handling, and the vulnerable lxml pin are fixed.","findings":"[T09] unexpected: Accepted as a material concern: artifact/juejin_skill/api.py exposes get/post methods that accept arbitrary URLs while automatically attaching the Juejin Cookie header when present.\n[T09] unexpected: Accepted as a material concern: artifact/juejin_skill/downloader.py validates the original image host but then uses follow_redirects=True, so redirected requests can exceed the documented image-domain allowlist.\n[T09] unexpected: Accepted as a material concern: artifact/juejin_skill/auth.py lets callers override cookie_path, and clear_cookie/save operations are not constrained to ~/.juejin_cookie.json.\n[TM1] expected: Downgraded: the rm ~/.juejin_cookie.json text is user-facing revocation guidance for a disclosed session-cookie file, not evidence of hidden destructive behavior.\n[PE3] expected: Downgraded: the ~/.ssh/id_rsa reference appears in documentation/comments explaining denied paths and is not code that reads SSH credentials.\n[SC4] unexpected: Dependency risk noted: requirements.txt pins lxml==5.3.0, which the advisory scanner flags as vulnerable; this supports review guidance but does not show malicious skill behavior.\n[E1] expected: External transmission to api.juejin.cn is expected for Juejin querying, draft creation, publishing, and article download. The behavior is disclosed and draft-only is the default, but it remains account-impacting when used.\n[RA2] expected: Downgraded: the persistent state is the disclosed Juejin cookie file, not a background worker, startup hook, cron job, or hidden persistence mechanism.\n[SDI-4] expected: Partially downgraded: SKILL.md separately declares the cookie write and output-directory writes. The config comment is imprecise for all writes, but the main artifact disclosure is not hidden.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789184213170}}}}}